    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<div class=\"spell-description\">\n  <p>\n      <strong>School:</strong>&nbsp;conjuration&nbsp;(summoning)&nbsp;[see text];\n    <br>\n    <strong>Level:</strong>&nbsp;Druid 9;\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    <br>\n    <strong>Components:</strong>&nbsp;V, S, F, DF<br>\n    \n      <strong>Casting Time:</strong>&nbsp;1 round<br>\n    <strong>Range:</strong>&nbsp;close (25 ft. + 5 ft./2 levels)<br>\n    \n    \n    <strong>Effect:</strong>&nbsp;One or more creatures, no two of which can be more than 30 ft. apart<br>\n    <strong>Duration:</strong>&nbsp;1 Round/Level (D)<br>\n    \n        <strong>Saving Throw:</strong>&nbsp;None\n        <br>\n        <strong>Spell Resistance:</strong>&nbsp;no<br>\n  </p>\n  <h2>Description</h2>\n  <p>This spell functions like @Compendium[warcraftrpg2e.spells.pwToH2PNia9Ts6Ed]{Summon Nature's Ally I}<em>, </em>except that you can summon one 9th-level creature, 1d3 8th-level creatures of the same kind, or 1d4+1 lower-level creatures of the same kind.</p>\n<p>When you use a summoning spell to summon an air, chaotic, earth, evil, fire, good, lawful, or water creature, it is a spell of that type.</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Summon_Nature&rsquo;s_Ally\"></span><span id=\"Summon_Nature.E2.80.99s_Ally\" class=\"mw-headline\">Summon Nature&rsquo;s Ally</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-headline\">@Compendium[warcraftrpg2e.summoning-roll-tables.jpSs0x2y9FYUeeAA]{Summon Nature's Ally I}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"mw-headline\">@Compendium[warcraftrpg2e.summoning-roll-tables.wC7LE0Y4qcMwyDKu]{Summon Nature's Ally II}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"mw-headline\">@Compendium[warcraftrpg2e.summoning-roll-tables.HzgTNwOhFgrVvpJY]{Summon Nature's Ally III}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"mw-headline\">@Compendium[warcraftrpg2e.summoning-roll-tables.tHXLiDRBeZhnD2OA]{Summon Nature's Ally IV}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"mw-headline\">@Compendium[warcraftrpg2e.summoning-roll-tables.ItDAMn5zRY74mHdt]{Summon Nature's Ally V}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"mw-headline\">@Compendium[warcraftrpg2e.summoning-roll-tables.EtJKkP0x5RQig8ja]{Summon Nature's Ally VI}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"mw-headline\">@Compendium[warcraftrpg2e.summoning-roll-tables.Cp3bv5pdVQxQwBOq]{Summon Nature's Ally VII}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"mw-headline\">@Compendium[warcraftrpg2e.summoning-roll-tables.fjpdwz83oKN3ClMU]{Summon Nature's Ally VIII}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"mw-headline\">@Compendium[warcraftrpg2e.summoning-roll-tables.s8yWjVWZZLVxLIq4]{Summon Nature's Ally IX}</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n"
